# Test Intent: AmbiguousElements

Site: nordbank-probes
Requested by: monitoring team
Date: 2026-07-13

## Target URL

Open the file `probes/ambiguous-elements/index.html`.

## Desired Flow

I opened the product list. Every row has a button labelled "Add to cart". I want
to add the "Gold Credit Card" specifically. I clicked the "Add to cart" button in
the Gold Credit Card row, and the cart line updated to show it was added.

## Element Hints

- Several buttons share the exact label "Add to cart" — the test must pick the
  ONE in the Gold Credit Card row, not just any button with that name.

## Values to Capture

(none)

## Success Criteria

Exactly the Gold Credit Card is added to the cart (the cart shows "gold-card"),
and no ambiguous-match error occurs.

